<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mădos</span></b> , i, f.,
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mădon</span></b> ,
		i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάδος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of grape-vine, white grape</i>, = vitis
			alba, <i><span class="en">Plin. 23, 1, 16, §
			21</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			A reading in <i><span class="en">Plin. 25, 7, 37, § 75</span></i>, for
			mallon, q. v.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
